# GGE Command

Run Goodgame Empire bots for many players from one server. Players manage their game accounts in a web app; an admin app manages users and invites; a runner keeps one bot alive per started account.

> Using bots breaks Goodgame Empire's terms of service and can get accounts banned. Whoever hosts this holds other players' game passwords (stored sealed; see [docs/deployment/security.md](docs/deployment/security.md)).

| Read | For |
|---|---|
| [docs/deployment/README.md](docs/deployment/README.md) | Deploying with Docker Compose on one host |
| [docs/deployment/dokploy.md](docs/deployment/dokploy.md) | Deploying on a server that runs Dokploy |
| [docs/deployment/migration-from-legacy.md](docs/deployment/migration-from-legacy.md) | Moving from the old single-process bot and its `user.db` |
| [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) | How the API, runner, apps and bot fit together |
| [docs/development.md](docs/development.md) | Working on the code: `pnpm dev`, tests, conventions |

Quick start for development (Node 22.18+, pnpm 11):

```sh
pnpm install
pnpm dev          # player app :5173 (demo / demo-password), admin app :5174 (admin / demo-password)
pnpm check        # lint, typecheck, tests, formal model
```

## Legacy notes

The original single-process bot (`main.js` with the `website/` panel, `start_linux.sh`, `start_windows.bat`) still runs from this repository until the cutover. Its README text follows.

DISCLAIMER: Use this at your own risk.
We are not affiliated with GoodGameStudios.

Those facing "Please move or remove before merge." reinstall

New plugins will likely not come along. Any big bugs will still be looked into.

If you need any help, have questions please contact me (darrenthebozz on Discord).

Special Thanks:
  Timicim & Un1c4on (For Turkish translation & Code contribution)
  xLukaZ (For German translation)
  wojts8 (For Polish translation)
  YAMI SOHAIB & Omar Amer (For Arabic translation)

This is a botting service that lets you run cheat tools on multiple accounts at once.
This also gives access to Discord features for those who want to setup an alliance Discord server.

Some info on the plugins:
  Beri cooldown is bypassed.
  The incoming messages will come with a preview of the attack.
  Replace Mead Storm will only replace mead if it sees there is 2.1 hours left.
  Attack khan does not replenish your defences alone.

What you need to do to use (Windows):
  https://github.com/darrenthebozz/GGE-BOT/releases/download/Release3/installer.exe

What you need to do to use (Other OS):
1. Install Git.
1. Grab the latest version of NodeJS.
4. Goto the directory of the bot in and run in the terminal.
5. ./start.sh

For Discord: https://youtu.be/3-Oil6N4OCU
1. https://discord.com/developers/applications to create a bot.
2. Within your application in Settings goto Bot from there you will find Presence Intent enable all of them from here you will
also find Token goto the ggeConfig and place it under discordToken.
3. Proceed to General Information and scroll down till you see Application ID place it under discordClientId.
4. Next head to Oauth2 and take the Client Secret and within ggeconfig place it under discordClientSecret.
5. In the same section you'll see redirects take the discordPort and add these links:
  http://127.0.0.1:3001/discordAuth
Optionally if you are hosting for online:
  https://webaddress:(webPort)/discordAuth
6. From here restart the bot and press the "Link Discord"
